1
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:12,400
Come on in.

2
00:00:15,679 --> 00:00:16,199
Take a look.

3
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:18,039
I got you a different room.

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:19,640
Don't worry.

5
00:00:20,199 --> 00:00:21,800
You can stay as long as you want this time.

6
00:00:22,359 --> 00:00:23,199
No one can kick you out.

7
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,079
There's one thing

8
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:29,719
I want to ask you.

9
00:00:31,239 --> 00:00:33,200
Dieyi has stayed tight-lipped about her past.

10
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:36,880
I feared bringing back painful memories,

11
00:00:37,520 --> 00:00:38,399
so I didn't dare press her.

12
00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,280
You hold this commemorative medal

13
00:00:41,280 --> 00:00:42,280
in such high regard,

14
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,240
and you said...

15
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,600
You said it can save you from the brink.

16
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,280
What does that really mean?

17
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:13,359
Two years ago,

18
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:17,120
a girl was dragged into Minchun Pavilion.

19
00:01:18,480 --> 00:01:21,359
She was locked in the basement for disobeying.

20
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,719
Everyone knew

21
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,920
that it was a place of no return.

22
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:29,799
She was forced to entertain

23
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:31,040
Minchun Pavilion's most vicious customer.

24
00:01:31,959 --> 00:01:32,799
That day,

25
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:35,400
the whip cracked relentlessly.

26
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:37,200
"Disobedient bitch!"

27
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,400
Yet I didn't hear a single

28
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,359
cry from the woman.

29
00:01:39,519 --> 00:01:40,480
"That'll teach you to disobey!"

30
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:42,640
We all thought the girl was dead.

31
00:01:44,159 --> 00:01:46,560
To our surprise, half an hour later,

32
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,400
we heard

33
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,799
a client's piercing shriek.

34
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:56,599
Overcome with curiosity,

35
00:01:56,719 --> 00:01:58,159
we ran out to see what was happening.

36
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,239
Normally, Minchun Pavilion

37
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,400
echoed with the wails of prostitutes.

38
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:07,840
It was the first time a client screamed.

39
00:02:07,959 --> 00:02:09,759
It was a scene we'd never imagined.

40
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:12,560
She was so clever.

41
00:02:13,120 --> 00:02:14,240
She thought to use a Peace buckle

42
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,680
to seek help from Sister Yumei.

43
00:02:16,439 --> 00:02:17,319
A key to unlock her restraints,

44
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,080
and knockout powder to subdue the client.

45
00:02:21,039 --> 00:02:22,319
Yet she had endured

46
00:02:22,319 --> 00:02:23,680
a full half-hour of brutal torment,

47
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,400
striking only when the drug took effect.

48
00:02:30,599 --> 00:02:31,639
She was so brave.

49
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,039
Holding the client hostage with chains,

50
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,919
she used shears to keep the thugs back.

51
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,319
Minchun Pavilion couldn't let him die.

52
00:02:40,599 --> 00:02:42,159
She seized on that weakness

53
00:02:43,039 --> 00:02:44,159
and held everyone at bay.

54
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,919
Just like that,

55
00:02:49,439 --> 00:02:50,639
step by step,

56
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,560
she carved a bloody path out

57
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:57,000
and walked out of Minchun Pavilion.

58
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:00,360
The thugs wanted to chase after her,

59
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,240
but Boss Ji held them back.

60
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,520
Boss Ji said nothing,

61
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,840
yet we all knew what it meant:

62
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:12,120
Minchun Pavilion could never cage her.

63
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:15,879
A year later,

64
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,840
Jasmine Ballroom opened in Rongcheng.

65
00:03:19,479 --> 00:03:20,719
The boss's name was

66
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,599
Chen Dieyi.

67
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,960
A master of social maneuvering,

68
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,520
she navigated every faction with ease.

69
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:28,680
No one could lay a finger on her.

70
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,080
Before her,

71
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:33,479
no one had escaped Minchun Pavilion.

72
00:03:34,439 --> 00:03:35,479
After her,

73
00:03:36,319 --> 00:03:37,199
others tried,

74
00:03:37,759 --> 00:03:38,560
but none succeeded.

75
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,400
She is a living exception,

76
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:44,680
and in our dreams,

77
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,800
we all yearn to become that exception,

78
00:03:52,199 --> 00:03:53,759
hoping to survive against all odds.

79
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:08,759
Dieyi!

80
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,240
Dieyi!

81
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,040
What's wrong?

82
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,759
You know now.

83
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,439
I didn't tell you before

84
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,199
because I didn't want you to ache for me.

85
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:28,560
Dieyi,

86
00:06:31,879 --> 00:06:32,920
let's be together.

87
00:06:34,680 --> 00:06:35,720
I came back from Japan

88
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:38,680
just to get engaged to you.

89
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:43,079
After wasting all these years,

90
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,519
all I want is to be with you.

91
00:06:51,079 --> 00:06:52,079
Together forever.

92
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:57,680
Lian Ye,

93
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,959
I don't want to be with you.

94
00:07:09,079 --> 00:07:09,800
Why?

95
00:07:12,639 --> 00:07:13,800
You're the only one I care about.

96
00:07:15,439 --> 00:07:16,160
Everything else...

97
00:07:17,519 --> 00:07:18,519
E-Everything else...

98
00:07:18,519 --> 00:07:20,000
I don't care about any of it.

99
00:07:25,439 --> 00:07:26,240
Because...

100
00:07:27,959 --> 00:07:28,839
I don't love you.

101
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,319
Sister Dieyi,

102
00:08:09,839 --> 00:08:11,199
why didn't you say yes to him?

103
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:13,680
Are you worried he'll look down on you?

104
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,120
This mortal body

105
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,199
will just be dust in a hundred years.

106
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:23,279
The world's harsh judgments—

107
00:08:24,279 --> 00:08:25,160
I don't care about any of that.

108
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,399
But Lian Ye...

109
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:30,879
His family was destroyed.

110
00:08:30,879 --> 00:08:31,720
His life has been hard enough.

111
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,559
I can't bear for him to suffer anymore.

112
00:08:36,279 --> 00:08:38,320
But you clearly both care for each other.

113
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:40,159
Can't you two just be together?

114
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,879
Apart,

115
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,799
we're each other's sword and shield.

116
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:46,639
Together, we'd be each other's weakness.

117
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:50,039
In these turbulent times,

118
00:08:50,879 --> 00:08:51,840
with our vengeance yet unpaid,

119
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:55,639
neither of us can afford to be a liability.

120
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:08,200
Who is that Jin Xiaohua to you?

121
00:09:14,559 --> 00:09:16,639
What... what's wrong with you?

122
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:19,840
I'm fine.

123
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:22,639
Jin Xiaohua is a friend of a friend.

124
00:09:24,159 --> 00:09:24,799
By the way, Baozhu,

125
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,960
Jin Xiaohua is in grave danger right now.

126
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:28,679
I'm keeping her in the Sanshan Gang

127
00:09:28,679 --> 00:09:29,720
to keep her safe.

128
00:09:30,919 --> 00:09:31,759
If one day...

129
00:09:32,759 --> 00:09:33,960
if I'm no longer in the Sanshan Gang,

130
00:09:34,399 --> 00:09:35,200
could you please

131
00:09:36,039 --> 00:09:36,919
protect her for me?

132
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:40,879
Don't worry. As long as I'm here,

133
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:41,799
no one will dare touch her.

134
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:46,559
Brother Lian!

135
00:09:47,080 --> 00:09:48,000
I heard the two girls held

136
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,000
by the Shipboard Guild broke out,

137
00:09:49,279 --> 00:09:50,559
escaped from Sun Hanji's residence,

138
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:51,679
and fled to the western suburbs.

139
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:53,799
Let's go check it out.

140
00:10:07,639 --> 00:10:09,159
Fine shooting, Director Li.

141
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:13,360
You asked me all the way out here...

142
00:10:13,799 --> 00:10:15,080
...surely not just to go hunting, right?

143
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,360
Of course not.

144
00:10:18,399 --> 00:10:19,000
Look there.

145
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,159
What do you mean?

146
00:10:30,639 --> 00:10:31,600
This Lian Ye...

147
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,919
He's ruined my plans time and again,

148
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,879
and even took Golden Peony away.

149
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,080
I must eliminate this thorn in my side.

150
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,399
Since you, Director Li,

151
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:44,919
could bury those two whores' case,

152
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:47,799
hushing this one up

153
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,559
should be no trouble at all, right?

154
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:56,759
Look over there.

155
00:11:04,159 --> 00:11:04,799
What's wrong?

156
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,440
Can't let go?

157
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:10,159
We can't share the Coastal Defense Map

158
00:11:10,960 --> 00:11:12,480
and break bread at the same table.

159
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,440
Brother Lian,

160
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:40,759
Brother Lian.

161
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:44,799
This way,

162
00:11:45,679 --> 00:11:46,679
you can rest easier, right?

163
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:49,759
Brother Li,

164
00:11:50,279 --> 00:11:52,120
you're far more capable than your father.

165
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:54,759
From now on,

166
00:11:55,759 --> 00:11:57,320
we're true brothers.

167
00:11:57,759 --> 00:11:58,320
Please.

168
00:12:11,519 --> 00:12:12,080
Dad...

169
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:13,320
What are you...

170
00:12:14,679 --> 00:12:16,600
Are you mixed up with Sun Hanji?

171
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:22,320
Kneel down!

172
00:12:24,879 --> 00:12:25,919
Get down on your knees!

173
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:29,120
Before our ancestors,

174
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:30,559
reflect on what you've done!

175
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,639
A filthy traitor like Sun Hanji—

176
00:12:33,159 --> 00:12:34,559
how could you associate with him?!

177
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,759
Didn't you partner with him before, too?

178
00:12:38,279 --> 00:12:40,039
I bore the shame of working with him

179
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,919
just so you could live differently,

180
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:43,120
different from me!

181
00:12:45,720 --> 00:12:46,679
You little bastard!

182
00:12:46,759 --> 00:12:47,879
Still defiant, aren't you?!

183
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:52,799
I'll beat you to death, you unfilial son!

184
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,399
I'll beat you to death, you unfilial son!

185
00:12:54,639 --> 00:12:55,480
Let me beat you to death!

186
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,039
I'll beat you to death, you unfilial son!

187
00:12:57,320 --> 00:12:58,399
I'll beat you to death!

188
00:12:58,679 --> 00:12:59,399
Beat you to death!

189
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:19,840
Come in.

190
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,600
I heard you were punished.

191
00:13:26,080 --> 00:13:26,960
I'm here to tend to your wounds.

192
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,039
No need.

193
00:13:28,399 --> 00:13:29,039
I can do it myself.

194
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:32,600
Do you despise me for my brothel past?

195
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:33,480
No, not at all.

196
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:35,720
It's just improper between men and women.

197
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,960
Then just think of me as a doctor.

198
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,320
To a doctor, gender doesn't matter.

199
00:13:39,440 --> 00:13:40,200
The patient comes first.

200
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:42,320
I'll leave it to you then.

201
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,559
I'm fine. It doesn't hurt.

202
00:13:58,200 --> 00:14:00,399
It's just that your hands are a bit cold.

203
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:04,360
I lacked food and clothing as a child,

204
00:14:05,159 --> 00:14:06,399
so I ended up with poor circulation.

205
00:14:06,919 --> 00:14:07,919
My hands and feet get cold easily.

206
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,919
Why didn't you just tell your father?

207
00:14:13,720 --> 00:14:14,639
He can't keep a secret.

208
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,440
Besides, letting him misunderstand me

209
00:14:17,360 --> 00:14:18,720
makes it easier to win Sun Hanji's trust.

210
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,679
You're an esteemed deputy chief,

211
00:14:22,559 --> 00:14:23,679
yet you risked your reputation

212
00:14:24,279 --> 00:14:25,679
to save courtesans like us.

213
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:27,279
Is it worth it?

214
00:14:27,919 --> 00:14:28,519
Saving you

215
00:14:30,919 --> 00:14:31,879
is saving Rongcheng.
